# Real sample evidence dropped at repo root for local testing (real emails,
# real screen recordings) — never belongs in git history. Root-only patterns
# (leading /) so this doesn't hide anything elsewhere in the tree.
/*.eml
/*.msg
/*.mov
/*.mp4
/*.m4v

# Extraction ground-truth fixtures are exported from real participant
# recordings — keep them local (see docs/extraction-benchmark.md).
/eval/*.json
